# Build context exclusions for production images (T08a2).
# The production Dockerfile does `COPY . /app`; without this file the 45 MB
# legacy dump (import-db/lms2.sql), the local MySQL data dir (dbdata/) and any
# local secrets would be baked into an image pushed to a registry.
.git
.gitignore
.planning
ralph.ps1
AGENTIC_WORKFLOW_GUIDE.md
docs
.github
dbdata
import-db
node_modules
public/build
bootstrap/ssr
bootstrap/cache
storage
tests
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
supervisord.log
supervisord.pid
runapp.sh
.phpunit.result.cache
.phpunit.cache
test-results
playwright-report
